 "final_passage": "On unseen layouts from the three map families used in training, Gannet achieved higher success rates than Ledger-RNN across all families (Warehouse: 88.4% vs 81.2%; Office: 85.1% vs 79.6%; Cavern: 79.3% vs 72.5%). Gannet also produced shorter mean episode lengths on successful episodes than Ledger-RNN in every family (Warehouse: 142 vs 158 steps; Office: 151 vs 163; Cavern: 177 vs 189). However, these results are descriptive only, as no statistical tests were reported, and they do not address generalization beyond the trained map families because all evaluations used unseen layouts from the same three families.",
